Package: cdx-agent
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 python3-httpx,
 adduser,
 systemd
Recommends: apparmor
Description: Construction DX OS device agent
 cdx-agent collects hardware inventory, sends periodic heartbeats, and
 fetches operational policy from the cdx-server central platform.
 .
 It runs as a dedicated system user (cdx-agent) under systemd with
 NoNewPrivileges and ProtectSystem=strict hardening. An optional
 AppArmor profile provides Mandatory Access Control.
 .
 Phase 1 features:
  - Signed HMAC-SHA256 requests (heartbeat, inventory, policy)
  - Offline-tolerant spool queue (drain on reconnect)
  - Full-jitter exponential backoff with Retry-After support
  - Structured JSON logging and Prometheus-compatible metrics
